    "/apis/v1/booking/rates": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Booking Hotel Rates\n\nThis operation returns what the page at `url` shows when it is fetched. Currency, language and regional content are decided by the rendered page and the location it is fetched from, not by your URL: URL parameters that select them (for example a currency or language parameter) may be ignored. Read the currency and locale values in the response instead of assuming the ones in your URL.\n\nStay dates are those of the rendered page. Compare `data.rates[].arrival_date` and `data.rates[].los` (number of nights) with the dates in your URL before using the rates.\n\n> **请求示例待验证。** 此接口的请求示例尚未在生产环境验证。静态示例用于说明请求格式，请替换为自己的参数。正式调用前，可用免费的报价模式（`X-AISA-Cost-Mode: quote`）查看预估费用。",
        "operationId": "post_booking_apis_v1_booking_rates",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "url": {
                    "pattern": "^https?://(?:[A-Za-z0-9-]+\\.)*[Bb][Oo][Oo][Kk][Ii][Nn][Gg]\\.(?:[A-Za-z]{2,}|(?:ac|co|com|edu|gov|net|org)\\.[A-Za-z]{2})(?::[0-9]+)?(?:[/?#]|$)\\S*$",
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "url"
                ],
                "type": "object"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "description": "The response envelope and container type are documented, but the business fields are not fully specified.",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "additionalProperties": true,
                      "minProperties": 1,
                      "type": "object"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "data"
                  ],
                  "type": "object"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Normalized successful response"
          },
          "default": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {}
              }
            },
            "description": "Error response; upstream passthrough responses may use provider formats"
          }
        },
        "summary": "Booking Hotel Rates",
